WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:08.448
Orders
The first tab: every live order of the venue, from the web, the tables and the platforms.

2
00:00:08.448 --> 00:00:13.102
Today in numbers
How many orders, how much money and how many are waiting now — at a glance.

3
00:00:13.102 --> 00:00:17.089
Live or history
The open orders, or the ones already closed.

4
00:00:17.089 --> 00:00:22.226
Search
By number, phone or street.

5
00:00:22.226 --> 00:00:32.837
The board
The columns follow an order’s path: PENDING → CONFIRMED → PREPARING → READY → IN DELIVERY.

6
00:00:32.837 --> 00:00:42.269
An order
Its number, items, total and how long it has waited. Tap it for the detail.

7
00:00:42.269 --> 00:00:51.094
The status
The same word the customer and the courier see.

8
00:00:51.094 --> 00:01:00.124
Seen
Stops the bell for an order you have seen, without moving it.

9
00:01:00.124 --> 00:01:08.967
More
In the history, loads older orders.

10
00:01:08.967 --> 00:01:13.993
The venue’s state
Customers see it on the site at once.

11
00:01:13.993 --> 00:01:18.591
Open
Orders come in as normal.

12
00:01:18.591 --> 00:01:23.033
Busy
Customers are warned of a longer wait.

13
00:01:23.033 --> 00:01:28.169
Closed
The site accepts no new orders.
